# The radio's own screen, as a section of its own.
#
# Filmed rather than described because the point is the shape rather than any one row: nine
# fields the Brick can change, then a heading, then three the radio decides and this client
# only reports - the language, and the two locks it has no verb to undo. A screen that offered
# all twelve would look exactly the same in a still.
scene demo
scale 4
delay 180
config

tab settings
hold 400
key down 5
hold 500
key a
hold 900
key down 9
hold 900
key b
hold 600
